ess_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"1klQuTKmJr-eMQPuFaQ5fg","review_id":"CPHcxLAc93yIr0S4MSkNSQ","date":"2020-11-12T23:58:29","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.941792368888855,"text_excerpt":"My husband and one of his best buddies had lunch at Anatolia and have been talking about it ever since. I had to know what was what so I headed over there for lunch as soon as I got the chance and knew I'd be in the area. This is a cute spot on Magazine where there are lots of pay-to-park spots in front, and there's also ample free parking on the side streets. I was welcomed and asked to sign in, then seated. The lady who waited on me was friendly, and also helpful when it came to menu questions. I had the hummus and a Greek salad. I added gyro meat for an additional fee. The hummus and pita were tasty, but please note that there was a little scoop of something in the middle of the hummus..."},{"business_id":"1klQuTKmJr-eMQPuFaQ5fg","review_id":"FcbA1RMk0G854LZ3kG9aiA","date":"2018-05-01T04:42:23","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9416660666465759,"text_excerpt":"Anatolia has a lot going right. Great location, friendly service and a menu more diverse than other mediterranean restaurants. I ordered the chick shawarma sandwich, fries and lebonese tea. The shawarma was good and flavorful. Otherwise not anything unique or different from others in the area. Fries are the seasoned crunchy type, good, but nothing special. I'd like to try some of the more unique turkish dishes on the menu and the hummus next time. Over all, great because of the location and outdoor seating on Magazine. Although the service was friendly and fast in the beginning, they seemed to forget me (their only patron while I was there) and I eventually had to go in and find someone t..."},{"business_id":"1klQuTKmJr-eMQPuFaQ5fg","review_id":"hYXwqeA45XDhG2EdIT20Sw","date":"2019-10-26T21:02:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9410420656204224,"text_excerpt":"Anatolia was a very pleasant surprise. We were on Magazine Street and jumped on Yelp to see what was good in the area. We really like Mediterranean food and the Turkish and Palestinian dishes here really impressed us. I highly recommend the falafel and the hummus, but you can't go wrong. The staff is very friendly and the food came out fast."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"1klQuTKmJr-eMQPuFaQ5fg","photo_id":"pXKPXNq0lGjtqCcrnTR4AQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/pXKPXNq0lGjtqCcrnTR4AQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8748760223388672},{"business_id":"1klQuTKmJr-eMQPuFaQ5fg","photo_id":"gzGvz9Dze_v6qgVautOPYA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/gzGvz9Dze_v6qgVautOPYA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8708769083023071},{"business_id":"1klQuTKmJr-eMQPuFaQ5fg","photo_id":"qM1U1UeWiowdOEqNB1tHjQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/qM1U1UeWiowdOEqNB1tHjQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8666324615478516},{"business_id":"1klQuTKmJr-eMQPuFaQ5fg","photo_id":"eu_KteLG9dvNchDPr0pPzQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/eu_KteLG9dvNchDPr0pPzQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8309861421585083},{"business_id":"1klQuTKmJr-eMQPuFaQ5fg","photo_id":"J8u1Q6venTsOmFPkfN4NpA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/J8u1Q6venTsOmFPkfN4NpA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7973570227622986}]},"notebook_case":null}
